(text
"1-bit SDMMC: CMD and DAT0..3 each have 10k pull-ups, including unused DAT1/2/3. CLK has source series termination.\nNo SD, display or network IO in DRDY ISR. Separate recording ring and explicit drop counters; no lossless claim.\nREC key toggles EEG start/stop after debounce. BOOT/RESET remain hardware buttons. All are 0.53mm low-profile metal dome switches.\nAMOLED model is an assembly envelope above 6mm insulated standoffs; check cable contacts and mechanical stack with actual parts."
